12/11/2026
- Introduced a shared feature-switch design, then migrated settings toggles to Bootstrap form-check-input switches.
- Added admin-managed Contact Information settings; header, footer, and Contact Us now share phone/email/address. Added working hours and Google Map embed URL/iframe support.
- Added Clear filter options to Default Languages and Stock Management.
- Added currency symbol dropdown on currency add/edit.
- Added Google reCAPTCHA v3 settings/service with keys, score, and action validation.
- Added Invoice Settings and customer invoice eligibility rules; added checkout, payment, and order-confirmed pages.
- Matched admin Product Reviews rating icons to the frontend SVG stars.

13/11/2026
- Added Page Builder All / Pages / Blog Posts tabs with counts and active states.
- Made blog additional categories functional, including combined counts.
- Deactivated reCAPTCHA because keys were unavailable, and added a Reset option.
- Added Pickup Points search button and matched its search field to All Products.
- Added soft deletes across the remaining app tables with restore-safe create handling.
- Prevented duplicate accounts using normalized email, logged-in POST blocking, and UniquePhone.
- Unified Add/Edit Category into _form.blade.php with a modern two-column layout.
- Changed reviews to one review per purchased order; verification scope recorded under.

16/11/2026
- Fixed admin sidebar design: submenu icons, auto-expand for active children, collapsed hover tooltips, and styling.
- Added admin-managed shipping.
- Fixed Homepage Latest Post View More button and added auto-latest option.
- Admin UX: logs per-page filter, subscribers clear button, stock search, readonly product part number.
- Settings: File System & Cache, social logins, Facebook/Google integrations, shipping links, cities search.
- Added System → Update and Server Status pages.
- Added the full Support module: admin tickets, product conversations, customer-facing pages, My Support, and standardized action buttons.
- Added global pagination go-to-page summary.

17/11/2026
- Added shared admin search partial with Search↔Clear toggle, rolled out to remaining pages including subscribers.
- Matched All Products rating stars to the frontend.
- Rebuilt Add/Edit Brand and Seller forms in Category style; restored brand website/description columns.
- Fixed sidebar active states: Setup & Configurations, My Profile, VAT & TAX.
- Fixed user Edit Profile photo upload using one multipart form with an avatar file input.



